The roots of Radix are one file of PEM certificates,
/system/resources/certificates/ca-certificates.crt, as Go's own
crypto/x509 reads them on Radix; root_unix.go's folders are Linux's and
the BSDs'.

diff -ruN a/github.com_google_certificate-transparency-go@v1.3.3/x509/root_radix.go b/github.com_google_certificate-transparency-go@v1.3.3/x509/root_radix.go
--- a/github.com_google_certificate-transparency-go@v1.3.3/x509/root_radix.go
+++ b/github.com_google_certificate-transparency-go@v1.3.3/x509/root_radix.go
@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
